{
  "_comment": "Right-click context help for the Leaders screen, transcribed from EVANHELP::_static_coloff_screen_help_list (16 entries) and _static_shipoff_screen_help_list (18) (evanhelp.cpp:170-212, s_help_box {help_id, x1, y1, x2, y2}), installed by Set_ColOff_Screen_Help_List_ / Set_ShipOff_Screen_Help_List_ (evanhelp.cpp:476-510) according to the view. `view` says which list an entry belongs to and the screen reads only that view's. `native` is the original's 640x480 rectangle and IS the region (the screen resolves it through core/researchnative, the conversion the drawing uses). A `row` entry is one leader row's: its top edge is pushed down by skills * 17 + 16 while that row lists skills (evanhelp.cpp:479-483, :493-497), which leaves the skill lines to their own help \u2014 the skill's text box (officer.cpp:1476-1482). The ship view also appends help 333 over its EMPTY big-icon cells (evanhelp.cpp:499-507); that one is computed by the screen from the grid, not listed here. First hit wins, the order is the original's.",
